so the first suggestion is that eating the corpses should have an
n% chance (perhaps 1/10?) of granting a point in the relevant stat.

The owl is a new creature, much the same as a raven in stats, with
the following additions;

1) Good eyesight. The owl ignores invisibility and displacement, as it
knows exactly where you are! If monster cooperation is ever implemented 
